e-created-aa/1265275-night-horrors-the-tormented-on-dtrpg?p=1265395#post1265395\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But can A Zeky reach the new dawn without killing themsleves from radiation poison right afterward?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That's completely gone. A Zeky's New Dawn is the same as any other Promethean's; their Azothic core is just a lot more unstable and powerful while getting there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-07T21:06:56-08:00","id":1265446,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iceblade44</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1265275-night-horrors-the-tormented-on-dtrpg?p=1265434#post1265434\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Medium<br /> <br /> That or Blind run</div> </div> </div> </div>I see whatcha did there.<br /> <br /> @Lelial good. I always thought It was literally pointless to have the option for the new dawn otherwise","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-07T22:53:37-08:00","id":1265452,"title":"","content":"So reading thai book, a question pops to my mind. Promethean Core stated very early on that there <i>might</i> be one hundred Prometheans on the planet at any given time. Yet reading Night Horrors, I get the distinct feeling that there are decidedly more Prometheans on the planet than that. Actaeon seems to taunt, troll, and blackmail plenty of other Created. Angel definitely tracks them down relatively frequently. And then Beatrice's write flat-out says that Prometheans around the world tracked the Matchbox throng and hundreds were crushed by their failure.<br /> <br /> So did canon shift somewhere between the two books? Or is this an oversight?<br /> <br /> (And I'm discussing this here rather then flagging errata because a) it seems like a good discussion and b) in my home games, there are somewhere between 1000 and 100000 Prometheans at any given time, so I really don't mind canon shifting on this.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-07T23:11:55-08:00","id":1265453,"title":"","content":"As a toolbox, any one, two, or all of these entities might exist in your game. Alternatively none of them might. The populations of your game are going to be what you want them to be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-08T01:43:52-08:00","id":1265467,"title":"","content":"Can I just say that the art in this book is amazing? The illustrations of Coeus and SK/23 are far creepier than anything I imagined.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-08T03:59:07-08:00","id":1265472,"title":"","content":"A fair few people in the Tormented section are lacking Bestowments. Which is annoying for the Extempore...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-08T04:24:13-08:00","id":1265477,"title":"","content":"I <i>did</i> find it odd how one of the write-ups spoke so casually about word getting around the Promethean community, as if it was a given that news of what happened would spread more or less immediately everywhere. I think it was in the backstory for clones.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-08T04:52:43-08:00","id":1265482,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1265275-night-horrors-the-tormented-on-dtrpg?p=1265452#post1265452\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So reading thai book, a question pops to my mind. Promethean Core stated very early on that there <i>might</i> be one hundred Prometheans on the planet at any given time. Yet reading Night Horrors, I get the distinct feeling that there are decidedly more Prometheans on the planet than that. Actaeon seems to taunt, troll, and blackmail plenty of other Created. Angel definitely tracks them down relatively frequently. And then Beatrice's write flat-out says that Prometheans around the world tracked the Matchbox throng and hundreds were crushed by their failure.<br /> <br /> So did canon shift somewhere between the two books? Or is this an oversight?</div> </div> </div> </div>It plays with canon. The Night Horrors books are uniquely suited to playing with previously established rules because they offer So. Many. characters and the intent is for ST's to choose the ones that fit their setting. In this case the IC rationale would be that only one of them exist in your setting (or Actaeon and Angel are gonna hunt the same Created pretty quickly, which could also be interesting) and they're expert trackers when it comes to Azothic Radiance. Remember that Radiance is also the in-game explanation for &quot;of the 100 Prometheans in the world, an entire throng and all their friends and enemies ended up <i>here</i>.&quot; (And if Azothic Radiance fails, the Divine Principle probably nudged them.) <br /> <br /> Having said that, I might change Beatrice's <i>hundreds</i> to <i>dozens</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Freelance Author and Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1713-mistress-of-whispers","name":"mistress of whispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1713_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-08T05:03:37-08:00","id":1265485,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1265275-night-horrors-the-tormented-on-dtrpg?p=1265477#post1265477\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I <i>did</i> find it odd how one of the write-ups spoke so casually about word getting around the Promethean community, as if it was a given that news of what happened would spread more or less immediately everywhere. I think it was in the backstory for clones.</div> </div> </div> </div>One of the things we needed to consider writing the core was &quot;how do Prometheans find each other&quot;. With so few numbers, they can't just walk around until they happen to find another Created. Enter Azothic Radiance and Pilgrimage Marks, the latter of which would include warnings about clones. Rambles are likewise a great way to pass stories around, and the short story anthology has Prometheans using online message boards.<br /> <br /> It's also good to keep in mind that &quot;the Promethean community&quot; in write-ups means the local Promethean community. For example, a clones' storyhook mentions a religious leader on national television, and yeah, I can absolutely imagine all Prometheans in ie America having some way of contacting each other.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Freelance Author and Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</b></span>","edited":{"userid":1713,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1713-mistress-of-whispers","user":"mistress of whispers","date":". 11-08-2018, 08:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1713-mistress-of-whispers","name":"mistress of whispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1713_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-08T05:07:35-08:00","id":1265487,"title":"","content":"In my vision of Promethian-land, it isn't that there are tons of the Created scattered everywhere, but they do still clump up--like tends to find like--and form comunities. That's what allows hunters like Angel to get out there and have a snack (or sometimes two).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Rick A. Carroll - Onyx Path Freelancer</b><br /> <b>Worked On</b>: Night Horrors: Enemy Action, Night Horrors: The Tormented<br /> <b>Working On: </b>Nada at the moment. Hire me!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2737-thrazghul","name":"Thrazghul","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2737_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-08T05:10:56-08:00","id":1265488,"title":"","content":"Oh; did I mention that I loved the examples of Mystery Cults in the book? Well, I did.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-08T05:14:31-08:00","id":1265489,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thrazghul</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1265275-night-horrors-the-tormented-on-dtrpg?p=1265487#post1265487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In my vision of Promethian-land, it isn't that there are tons of the Created scattered everywhere, but they do still clump up--like tends to find like--and form comunities. That's what allows hunters like Angel to get out there and have a snack (or sometimes two).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Def. There's practical benefits to being around other Prometheans (Pilgrimage advice, and less Disquiet if you're in a mixed throng) as well as the emotional solace of being around people who get what it's like. So they tend to congregate and stick together. (Except maybe for Zeky, who are hella dangerous to be around even by Created standards.) So all Actaeon and Angel need to do is find such a community, and they're good for a while.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Freelance Author and Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1713-mistress-of-whispers","name":"mistress of whispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1713_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-08T06:12:13-08:00","id":1265500,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thrazghul</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1265275-night-horrors-the-tormented-on-dtrpg?p=1265487#post1265487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In my vision of Promethian-land, it isn't that there are tons of the Created scattered everywhere, but they do still clump up--like tends to find like--and form comunities. That's what allows hunters like Angel to get out there and have a snack (or sometimes two).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah, a flotsam and jetsam comparison is VERY apt for Prometheans.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-08